{"seq":3,"slug":"nonlocality-bell","title":"非定域与 Bell 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/quantum/nonlocality-bell","wordCount":2189,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"非定域与-bell-定理\">非定域与 Bell 定理</h1><p>1935 年爱因斯坦、波多尔斯基和罗森写下 EPR 论文，想证明量子力学不完备：既然可以在不干扰某粒子的情况下、通过测量它的远方伙伴来预知它的位置或动量，那这些性质必定是粒子本来就有的「实在要素」，量子力学没写出它们，故不完备。这看似无懈可击的哲学论证，在 1964 年被贝尔（John Bell）做成了一个可以被实验检验的不等式——从此「定域实在论对不对」不再是形而上学口水战，而成了实验室里能一锤定音的经验问题。2022 年的诺贝尔物理学奖，颁给的正是敲下这一锤的人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>定域实在论</strong>（local realism）是两条直觉的合取：<strong>实在论</strong>（测量结果由测量前就存在的性质决定，即隐变量）与<strong>定域性</strong>（一处的测量瞬时不影响远处类空分离的结果）。Bell 定理证明：任何满足定域实在论的理论，其测量关联必满足一个不等式（Bell/CHSH 不等式）；而量子力学预测在某些设置下<strong>违反</strong>该不等式。因此定域实在论与量子力学不可兼容——两者至多一真。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[EPR: 量子力学不完备?] --&gt; B[假设定域实在论/隐变量]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Bell 1964: 推出 Bell 不等式]&#10;  C --&gt; D[量子力学预测: 违反不等式]&#10;  D --&gt; E[实验裁决]&#10;  E --&gt; F[1972-82 Clauser/Aspect: 违反, 有漏洞]&#10;  E --&gt; G[2015 无漏洞实验: 违反]&#10;  F --&gt; H[定域实在论被排除]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{放弃定域性 还是 实在论}\">graph TD\n  A[EPR: 量子力学不完备?] --&gt; B[假设定域实在论/隐变量]\n  B --&gt; C[Bell 1964: 推出 Bell 不等式]\n  C --&gt; D[量子力学预测: 违反不等式]\n  D --&gt; E[实验裁决]\n  E --&gt; F[1972-82 Clauser/Aspect: 违反, 有漏洞]\n  E --&gt; G[2015 无漏洞实验: 违反]\n  F --&gt; H[定域实在论被排除]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{放弃定域性 还是 实在论}</pre><p>CHSH 版本用四个测量设置的关联函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 构造量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = |E(a,b) - E(a,b&#x27;) + E(a&#x27;,b) + E(a&#x27;,b&#x27;)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。定域实在论要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\le 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>；量子力学对最优纠缠态与设置给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.83</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = 2\\sqrt{2} \\approx 2.83</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.83</span></span></span></span></span>（Tsirelson 界）。实验测到的正是接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的值——大自然站在量子力学一边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bell-不等式-把哲学变成数字\">Bell 不等式：把哲学变成数字</h2><p>Bell 论证的精髓在于它不依赖量子力学的任何细节，只依赖定域实在论本身。设想两地 Alice 和 Bob 各测一个从共同源发出的粒子，各自可选测量方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每次得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。若结果由粒子携带的共同隐变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定（实在论），且 Alice 的结果只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、不依赖 Bob 的选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（定域性），那么对关联函数做纯代数运算即得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\le 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这一步的哲学重量怎么强调都不过分：它把「世界是否定域实在」这个纯形而上学命题，翻译成了一个关于可测关联的<strong>数值上界</strong>。这是物理学哲学史上罕见的成就——一个形而上学立场被赋予了可证伪的经验内容（回想 <a href=\"../foundations/why-philosophy-of-physics\">为何物理学哲学</a> 说物理学哲学接手于经验证据用尽处，而 Bell 定理恰恰把原以为超经验的问题重新拉回经验战场）。CHSH（Clauser-Horne-Shimony-Holt）随后给出了适合真实实验的可操作版本，代价是引入了若干需要实验去封堵的「漏洞」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-clauser-到无漏洞实验-把漏洞逐个关上\">从 Clauser 到无漏洞实验：把漏洞逐个关上</h2><p>理论有了不等式，实验却要几十年才能给出无懈可击的裁决，因为每个「漏洞」都可能让一个巧妙的定域实在论模型伪装出违反的假象。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>代表实验</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n<th>遗留漏洞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1972</td>\n<td>Clauser &amp; Freedman（钙原子级联光子）</td>\n<td>违反 Bell 不等式</td>\n<td>探测+定域性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1982</td>\n<td>Aspect 等（快速切换测量方向）</td>\n<td>违反，关闭定域性漏洞</td>\n<td>探测效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>Hensen 等（金刚石 NV 电子自旋，相距 1.3 km）</td>\n<td>无漏洞违反</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>Giustina 等 / Shalm 等（纠缠光子）</td>\n<td>无漏洞违反</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两大关键漏洞是：<strong>定域性（通信）漏洞</strong>——若两地测量的时间间隔允许光速信号往来，则一方的设置可能影响另一方；Aspect 1982 年用测量中途快速切换方向来封堵它。<strong>探测（公平采样）漏洞</strong>——若探测器只捕获一部分粒子，未被探测的样本可能恰好掩盖真相；需要足够高的探测效率。2015 年，Hensen 团队用相距 1.3 公里的金刚石氮空位中心电子自旋，首次<strong>同时</strong>关闭这两大漏洞，实现无漏洞 Bell 违反（Nature 526, 682, 2015）；同年 Giustina 与 Shalm 两组用纠缠光子独立达成同一结论。定域实在论至此被实验排除，再无退路。这项工作直接促成 <strong>2022 年诺贝尔物理学奖</strong>授予 Aspect、Clauser、Zeilinger，表彰他们「用纠缠光子实验确立 Bell 不等式违反并开创量子信息科学」（nobelprize.org）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到底放弃了什么-定域还是实在\">到底放弃了什么：定域还是实在</h2><p>一个极其常见的误读是「Bell 实验证明了非定域」或「证明了量子纠缠能超光速通信」。两者都错。Bell 定理排除的是<strong>定域实在论</strong>这个合取，因此逻辑上你可以选择放弃其中任一支（或两支），不同诠释做出了不同选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>玻姆力学</strong>保留实在论（粒子有确定位置），放弃定域性——它是显式非定域的（见 <a href=\"interpretations\">诠释</a>），Bell 关联在它那里由导波的非定域依赖直接实现。</li>\n<li><strong>哥本哈根/QBism</strong> 倾向放弃「测量前性质已确定」的实在论，保住某种定域性——若波函数只是知识/信念，就没有需要被瞬时影响的远方实在要素。</li>\n<li><strong>多世界</strong>则声称两者都不必放弃：既然测量不产生唯一结果、两地各自分支，就无所谓「一方影响另一方」，Bell 的实在论前提（单一确定结果）根本不适用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论怎么选，有一条铁律不容触碰：<strong>无信号定理</strong>（no-signaling）。量子非定域关联虽强于任何经典关联，却<strong>不能用于超光速传递信息</strong>——因为 Alice 单方的测量统计完全不依赖 Bob 的设置，只有把两地记录事后比对才看得到关联。这守住了狭义相对论的因果序底线（见 <a href=\"../spacetime/relativity-simultaneity\">相对论与同时性</a>）：量子非定域是一种「不能传信号的关联」，它与相对论和平共处，却把「实在」的经典图像永久击碎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"余波-从悖论到资源\">余波：从悖论到资源</h2><p>Bell 定理的命运是物理学哲学最励志的故事之一：一个曾被主流物理学界当作「哲学思辨、无关痛痒」的问题，如今成了整个量子信息技术的基石。正因为 Bell 违反标志着「无法被任何经典定域模型模拟的关联」，它被转化为可利用的<strong>资源</strong>——<strong>设备无关的量子密钥分发</strong>（DIQKD）用 Bell 违反来认证密钥的安全性（哪怕设备是敌方造的），<strong>认证随机数</strong>用它来保证随机性的真实。这些协议 2023 年前后已在实验室实现原型。当年爱因斯坦用来质疑量子力学的「幽灵般的超距作用」，最终变成了下一代信息技术的引擎，其前沿脉络见 <a href=\"../practice/philosophy-of-physics-in-practice\">前沿与边界</a>。</p>\n<p>哲学上，Bell 定理还有一层未尽的余波：它的前提里除了定域性与实在论，还悄悄用了「测量设置可自由选择」（measurement independence）。若放弃这一条——即接受<strong>超决定论</strong>（superdeterminism），设置与隐变量从一开始就被共同原因关联——原则上可保住定域实在论。绝大多数物理学家拒绝这条路，因为它似乎摧毁了科学实验的意义（你无法真正「随机」选设置）。这一残留争点，把 Bell 定理与自由意志、决定论的一般哲学问题连在了一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EPR 用定域实在论论证量子力学不完备；Bell 1964 把定域实在论翻译成可检验的不等式（CHSH 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S\\le2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，量子力学给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=2\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），使形而上学立场获得可证伪的经验内容。</li>\n<li>实验从 1972 年 Clauser、1982 年 Aspect（关定域性漏洞）到 2015 年 Hensen/Giustina/Shalm 的无漏洞违反，逐一封堵探测与通信漏洞，定域实在论被彻底排除；2022 年诺奖表彰这一成就。</li>\n<li>Bell 排除的是「定域+实在」的合取，逻辑上可择一放弃：玻姆弃定域、哥本哈根/QBism 弃实在、多世界称两者皆不必弃；但无信号定理守住相对论因果序，非定域不能传信号。</li>\n<li>Bell 违反从「悖论」转化为「资源」：设备无关量子密钥分发与认证随机数以它为安全基石；残留的超决定论漏洞把它连向自由意志与决定论的一般争论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"measurement-problem\">测量问题</a>、<a href=\"interpretations\">诠释（哥本哈根/多世界/玻姆）</a>、<a href=\"../spacetime/relativity-simultaneity\">相对论与同时性</a>、<a href=\"../practice/philosophy-of-physics-in-practice\">前沿与边界</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：随机性与概率的本性见 <a href=\"../../philosophy-of-probability/practice/randomness\">概率哲学：随机性</a>；因果的一般分析见 <a href=\"../../metaphysics/causation-modality-and-significance/causation\">形而上学：因果</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"非定域与 Bell 定理","id":"非定域与-bell-定理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Bell 不等式：把哲学变成数字","id":"bell-不等式-把哲学变成数字"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Clauser 到无漏洞实验：把漏洞逐个关上","id":"从-clauser-到无漏洞实验-把漏洞逐个关上"},{"level":2,"text":"到底放弃了什么：定域还是实在","id":"到底放弃了什么-定域还是实在"},{"level":2,"text":"余波：从悖论到资源","id":"余波-从悖论到资源"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"诠释：哥本哈根、多世界、玻姆及其他","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/quantum/interpretations"},"next":{"title":"时间之箭：熵与不可逆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-physics/practice/arrow-of-time"}}